    <p><strong>Executive Summary:</strong> SM'S DEX is an open-source Pokédex developer portfolio built on Astro, native Web Audio API, and GitHub Actions CI. It replaces typical PokeAPI tutorial SPA clones with zero-client-JS HTML, synthesized chiptune audio (0KB assets), and automated community roster pull requests with strict JSON Schema validation.</p>
